{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110748","id":2847170954,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ptGGK","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110748","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110748.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110748.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110748","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110748/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110748/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110748/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ffa2651fbc9245548afb1d023ee425be4a042f86","number":110748,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add ability to get list of Project Settings changed, similar to Editor Settings functionality","user":{"login":"MauriceButler","id":657135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NzEzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/657135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler","html_url":"https://github.com/MauriceButler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MauriceButler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Introduces new functions `get_changed_settings` and `check_changed_settings_in_group`. This brings Project Settings to parity with the Editor Settings functionality.\r\n\r\nThis allows much more fine-grained responses to setting changes.\r\n\r\nThis approach is non-breaking.\r\n\r\n``` gdscript\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.connect(_on_project_settings_changed)\r\n\t\r\nfunc _on_project_settings_changed() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"_on_project_settings_changed\")\r\n\t\r\n\tif !ProjectSettings.check_changed_settings_in_group('my_settings'):\r\n\t\treturn\r\n\r\n\tvar changed_settings = ProjectSettings.get_changed_settings()\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nAs part of this, the `settings_changed` is now only emitted when a settings value is set to a different value.\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110747\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13244\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://githu